  "description": "All that you need to know about Crackhunt Description: Crackhunt is a cybersecurity-based gaming event organized by the ISDF Club at AIT The event focuses on problem-solving and security challenges Any violation of the rules will result in disqualification Rules: The duration of the event is 3 hours; any levels completed outside this window will not be counted Attacking servers of any kind, including DDoS attacks or scripting attacks, will lead to immediate disqualification Sharing puzzle answers is strictly prohibited Multiple logins using the same ID will result in disqualification Posting puzzles or levels on public forums, messaging boards, or similar platforms is not allowed Use of LLMs and AI tools is not permitted The event will be hosted on the official event website Additional Information: Participants may contact the organizing team for any queries or doubts",
